---
description: Mandatory repository orientation and historical-work recovery
alwaysApply: true
---

Read root `AGENTS.md` before substantial work. It is the canonical instruction entry point.

Then follow:
- `docs/AGENT_OPERATING_SYSTEM.md` for source authority, all-branch/full-history search and recovery of abandoned work;
- `docs/AGENT_NAVIGATION.md` for the repository-specific architecture map.

If prior work may exist, use `tools/agent_history.py` before creating a replacement. For exact code locations on any branch/commit use `python tools/build_agent_index.py --ref "<branch-or-SHA>"`.

Do not assume `main` contains the whole project history.
